#心灵感应#LAST#\n能让你心灵感应到任何生物，哪怕它不在你的视线范围内。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"00a01ff3a8676bd99ea74ef1d546ab5e34b07570f9c82fd44c39e12990de3836","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7a980d905255c20bdf47dc871ae401ba11decfd50a5a8918394327fe4a9de415","logical_entry_identity":"56c9c534d4dc48b14bbdea55c006430e0bff3242455e3dc4b81d0c9b7b991c71","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Damage resistance: creature type#LAST#\nAll damage you receive from creatures of this type, through any means, is decreased by this percentage.  This is applied separately to (stacks with) normal resistances.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#伤害抗性：生物类型#LAST#\n任何方式受到指定生物类型的伤害，不管造成伤害的方式是什么，都按此值减免。这一效果与普通伤害抗性各自独立生效。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ea00c0f7ae310a54b49fc355cc0b364e5ce4fcc088fca4312fcb19e6a6b80654","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7a9a616098c17bba275f0ad7145e559d83addb37f5653cc8ad16e417bdf677ee","logical_entry_identity":"f6150a26f24b1f0e31331e28e4227b508a7073655fc57d117b27dd43a715e9b3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your subconscious now retaliates when you take damage.  If the attacker is within range (%d), you'll inflict mind damage equal to the Feedback gained from the attack or %0.2f, whichever is lower.\n\t\tThis effect can only happen once per creature per turn.\n\t\tThe damage will scale with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的潜意识会报复那些伤害你的人。\n\t\t当攻击者在 %d 码范围内时，你会对目标造成伤害，伤害值为因承受此攻击而获得的反馈数值（但不超过 %0.2f）。\n\t\t此效果每回合对同一生物最多只能触发 1 次。\n\t\t受精神强度影响，伤害按比例加成。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}